<title>BELGIUM: EU says clears BT/Tele Danmark Swiss deal.</title>
<headline>EU says clears BT/Tele Danmark Swiss deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it had cleared a plan by British Telecommunications Plc , Tele Danmark A/S and three Swiss companies to acquire control of Swiss telecoms company Newtelco AG.</p>
</text>
